sk has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"actualFinishDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"If set, this is the actual date when work was completed on this Task.\r\n            \r\nThis value contains only the date in year-month-day format.  For display, this\r\ndate will always be shown as this same year-month-day regardless of time zone.\r\nFor reporting purposes, this date is calculated against the official time zone\r\nof the Workspace.\r\n            \r\nFor example: A Task has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"actualEffort":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The actual effort (in minutes) for this Task."},"actualDuration":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The actual duration (in minutes) for this Task."},"actualCost":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"The actual cost of this Task to date, if known."},"plannedCost":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"The planned cost for this Task.  Cannot be negative."},"plannedDuration":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The planned duration (in minutes) for this Task."},"plannedEffort":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The planned effort (in minutes) for this Task."},"priorityId":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Return the priority of a task"},"percentComplete":{"type":"integer","description":"The numerical percentage, from 0-100, representing the percentage completion\r\nfor this Task.  Any numbers below zero or above 100 will be clamped to the\r\nminimum or maximum value.\r\n            \r\nThis value