RL is generated as /assets/images/avatars/{index:000}.png.\r\nOnly numeric public avatars are accepted; custom URLs are not supported."},"defaultPlannedHours":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"Default planned effort in hours. When set, updates the resource; when omitted, existing value is unchanged."},"workingDays":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResourceWorkingDaysHours"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Per-day working hours. When non-null, updates or creates the resource calendar; set only days to change—they merge over workspace defaults."}},"required":["resourceId"],"description":"Represents the values to apply to a single Resource as part of a bulk Resource update API call.\r\n            \r\nThis is a deliberately reduced version of Astro.Api.Dto.Resources.ResourceUpdateDto. Only fields that are\r\nsensible to update across many Resources at once are included. The following fields are intentionally\r\nomitted because they represent per-person identity or carry per-Resource side effects that should not\r\nbe applied in bulk:\r\n            \r\n- Email: cannot be changed once assigned and is unique per person.\r\n- RoleId: triggers invite-permission, account-owner and last-global-admin logic.\r\n- IsActive: triggers last-global-admin and license-count logic.\r\n- HourlyRate: triggers workspace-wide hourly rate recalculations.\r\n- ClearAvatar: removes the stored avatar image and deletes the asset from S3.","title":"ResourceBulkUpdateDto"},"ResourceSkillDtoListAstroResult":{"type":"object","properties":{"error":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AstroError"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"If the API call failed, this will contain information about the error that occurred."},"success":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if the API call succeeded; false otherwise."},"hasError":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if the API call failed."},"statusCode":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpStatusCode","description":"The HTTP code of the response."},"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResourceSkillDto"},"description":"If the API call succeeded, this will contain the results."}},"description":"An API result that contains different values depending on whether the API call succeeded or failed.\r\nIf the API call succeeded, the `Success` value will be true and you can use the `Data` element.\r\nIf the API call failed, `Success` will be false and the `Error` value will be non-null.","title":"ResourceSkillDtoListAstroResult"},"CreateResourceSkillDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"The name of this Skill."}},"required":["name"],"description":"This is a skill that can be allocated to a resource.","title":"CreateResourceSkillDto"},"ResourceSkillDtoAstroResult":{"type":"object","properties":{"error":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AstroError"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"If the API call failed, this will contain information about the error that occurred."},"success":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if the API call succeeded; false otherwise."},"hasError":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if the API call failed."},"statusCode":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpStatusCode","description":"The HTTP code of the response."},"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResourceSkillDto","description":"A ResourceSkill is a capability possessed by this Resource that can be used to\r\ndetermine appropriate assignments.  Some Resources may have ResourceSkills that\r\nare in high demand and some Tasks may have a requirement for Resources with particular\r\nResourceSkills."}},"description":"An API result that contains different values depending on whether the API call succeeded or failed.\r\nIf the API call succeeded, the `Success` value will be true and you can use the `Data` element.\r\nIf the API call failed, `Success` will be false and the `Error` value will be non-null.","title":"ResourceSkillDtoAstroResult"},"UpdateRe