"The HTTP code of the response."},"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaskDetailsDto","description":"A Task is an individual element of work that must be performed to complete a Project.  A\r\nTask can have one or more Resources assigned to it.  Tasks can be linked to other Tasks to\r\nindicate whether they have a dependency or a connection."}},"description":"An API result that contains different values depending on whether the API call succeeded or failed.\r\nIf the API call succeeded, the `Success` value will be true and you can use the `Data` element.\r\nIf the API call failed, `Success` will be false and the `Error` value will be non-null.","title":"TaskDetailsDtoAstroResult"},"TaskUpdateDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The common name of this Task."},"description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"A description of the work to be performed in this Task."},"percentComplete":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":0,"maximum":100,"description":"The numerical percentage, from 0-100, representing the percentage completion\r\nfor this Task.  Any numbers below zero or above 100 will be clamped to the\r\nminimum or maximum value.\r\n            \r\nThis value can be edited manually in the Gantt chart view of the application,\r\nor can be selected on the Task Detail page within the Kanban board."},"statusId":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uuid","description":"The TaskStatus assigned to this Task."},"priorityId":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The unique identifier of the TaskPriority"},"plannedStartDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"The date when work on this Task is planned to begin.\r\n            \r\nThis value contains only the date in year-month-day format.  For display, this\r\ndate will always be shown as this same year-month-day regardless of time zone.\r\nFor reporting purposes, this date is calculated against the official time zone\r\nof the Workspace.\r\n            \r\nFor example: A Task has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"plannedFinishDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"The date when work on this Task is expected to complete.\r\n            \r\nThis value contains only the date in year-month-day format.  For display, this\r\ndate will always be shown as this same year-month-day regardless of time zone.\r\nFor reporting purposes, this date is calculated against the official time zone\r\nof the Workspace.\r\n            \r\nFor example: A Task has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"plannedDuration":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":0,"maximum":6570000,"default":null,"description":"The planned duration (in minutes) for this Task.  Cannot be negative."},"plannedEffort":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":0,"maximum":2147483647,"default":null,"description":"The planned effort (in minutes) for this Task.  Cannot be negative."},"plannedCost":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","minimum":0,"default":null,"description":"The planned cost for this Task.  Cannot be negative."},"actualStartDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"If set, this is the actual date when work began on the Task.\r\n            \r\nThis value contains only the date in year-month-day format.  For display, this\r\ndate will always be shown as this same year-month-day regardless of time zone.\r\nFor reporting purposes, this date is calculated against the official time zone\r\nof the Workspace.\r\n            \r\nFor example: A Task has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"actualFinishDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"If set, this is the actual date when work was completed on the Task.\r\n            \r\nThis value contains only the date in year-month-day format.  For display, this\r\ndate will always be shown as this same year-month-day regardless of time zone.\r\nFor reporting purposes, this date is calculated against the official time zone\r\nof the Workspace.\r\n            \r\nFor example: A Task has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"actualDuration":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":0,"maximum":6570000,"default":null,"description":"The actual duration (in minutes) for this Task.  Cannot be negative."},"actualCost":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","minimum":0,"description":"If set, this represents the actual tracked cost for this Task."},"theme":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Color theme definition for this task.\r\n            \r\neg. Blue, Brown, DarkBlue, DarkGrey, Gold, Green, Grey, LightBrown, LightGreen,\r\nLightGrey, LightPurple, LightYellow, Magenta, Mauve, Navy, Orange, Purple, Red."},"isLocked":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"Unlocked tasks can be adjusted by changes to their dependencies, resource leveling, or other factors.\r\n            \r\nAll tasks are unlocked by default.\r\n            \r\nIf a task is set to `IsLocked` = `true`, the dates and assigned resources are locked for this task and will not\r\nbe automatically changed by any process."},"isMilestone":{"type":["boolean","null"],"description":"True if this task is a milestone.  Milestones represent a specific point in time for the project.  When a\r\nmilestone is locked, it represents a fixed time within the project that can be used to relate to other tasks."},"breakRecurrency":{"type":"boolean","description":"Set this to true to break this Task out of its recurring series as part of this update.\r\n            \r\nThe Task is detached from its series, clearing its parent/child relationship and its\r\nrecurrence settings.  Any other changes in the same update are then applied to this\r\nTask alone rather than being propagated across the rest of the series.\r\n            \r\nThis has no effect if the Task is not part of a recurring series.  A Task can only be\r\nmade recurring through the TaskRecurrency endpoints."},"moveToProject":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MoveTaskToProjectDto"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Object contains data to move task to another project"}},"description":"A Task is an individual element of work that must be performed to complete a Project.  A\r\nTask can have one or more Resources assigned to it.  Tasks can be linked to other Tasks to\r\nindicate whether they have a dependency or a connection.","title":"TaskUpdateDto"},"ChangeSetStatusDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"changeSetId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of this Changeset"},"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of the entity affected by this Changeset.  For example, if this\r\nChangeset was created for a Task, this value will be the unique identifier for the Task."}},"description":"Returns the id of a specific ChangeSet","title":"ChangeSetStatusDto"},"ChangeSetStatusDtoAstroResult":{"type":"object","properties":{"error":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AstroError"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"If the API call failed, this will contain information about the error that occurred."},"success":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if the API call succeeded; false otherwise."},"h