el that contains the value for a TaskField."}},"description":"An API result that contains different values depending on whether the API call succeeded or failed.\r\nIf the API call succeeded, the `Success` value will be true and you can use the `Data` element.\r\nIf the API call failed, `Success` will be false and the `Error` value will be non-null.","title":"TaskFieldValueDtoAstroResult"},"UpdateTaskFieldValueDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"value":{"type":"string","description":"The new value to be set for this TaskField."}},"description":"A model that contains a new value to be set for a TaskField.","title":"UpdateTaskFieldValueDto"},"TaskLinkCreateDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"successorTaskId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of the successor Task to link to.  This Task must be in the same\r\nProject as the predecessor Task the link is being created from."},"linkType":{"type":"string","description":"The type of dependency between the two Tasks. Case-insensitive; stored and returned in camelCase.\r\n            \r\nValid values: finishToStart, startToStart, finishToFinish, startToFinish.\r\nDefaults to finishToStart when omitted."},"lag":{"type":"integer","minimum":-1000,"maximum":1000,"description":"The number of days of lag (or lead, if negative) between the two Tasks."}},"description":"Represents a new link (dependency) to create from one Task to another.","title":"TaskLinkCreateDto"},"TaskLinkUpdateDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"linkType":{"type":"string","description":"The type of dependency between the two Tasks. Case-insensitive; stored and returned in camelCase.\r\n            \r\nValid values: finishToStart, startToStart, finishToFinish, startToFinish."},"lag":{"type":"integer","minimum":-1000,"maximum":1000,"description":"The number of days of lag (or lead, if negative) between the two Tasks."}},"description":"Represents an update to the type and/or lag of an existing link (dependency) between two Ta