 call succeeded, the `Success` value will be true and you can use the `Data` element.\r\nIf the API call failed, `Success` will be false and the `Error` value will be non-null.","title":"TaskStatusDtoAstroResult"},"TaskStatusUpdateDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The name of this TaskStatus."},"order":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"A numerical value that can be used to sort TaskStatus values according to the\r\nneeds of your business."}},"description":"A TaskStatus is a named status level used by your business to determine how to measure the\r\nprogress of Tasks.  You can define your own named status levels that are appropriate for\r\nyour business and determine which status levels are considered done.","title":"TaskStatusUpdateDto"},"TaskStatusMoveDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"taskId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of the Task to move."},"position":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":0,"description":"The zero-based position the Task should occupy within the target TaskStatus.  When not\r\nspecified, the Task is moved to the end of the TaskStatus."}},"required":["taskId"],"description":"A request to move a single Task into a TaskStatus.  The Task is placed at the specified\r\nPosition within the target TaskStatus, or at the end when no Position is given.  When the\r\nTask is already in the target TaskStatus, only its position changes.","title":"TaskStatusMoveDto"},"TaskStatusMoveResultDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"taskId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of the Task that was moved."},"success":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether the move was accepted for this Task."},"message":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The reason the move was rejected, when Success is false."},"changeSetId":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uuid","description":"When the Task belongs to a Project, the move is applied asynchronously as a Changeset\r\nand this contains its unique identifier.  You can use RetrieveChangeset to check the\r\nprogress of the move.  This is null when the move was applied immediately."}},"description":"The result of moving a single Task into a TaskStatus.  One result is returned per\r\nrequested Task move, in the same order as the request.","title":"TaskStatusMoveResultDto"},"TaskStatusMoveResultDtoListAstroResult":{"type":"object","properties":{"error":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AstroError"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"If the API call failed, this will contain information about the error that occurred."},"success":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if the API call succeeded; false otherwise."},"hasError":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if the API call failed."},"statusCode":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpStatusCode","description":"The HTTP code of the response."},"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaskStatusMoveResultDto"},"description":"If the API call succeeded, this will contain the results."}},"description":"An API result that contains different values depending on whether the API call succeeded or failed.\r\nIf the API call succeeded, the `Success` value will be true and you can use the `Data` element.\r\nIf the API call failed, `Success` will be false and the `Error` value will be non-null.","title":"TaskStatusMoveResultDtoListAstroResult"},"TimesheetTaskDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of this Task."},"projectId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of the Project to which this Task belongs."},"shortId":{"type":"string","description":"A short ID that can be used to refer to this Task.  This short ID is\r\nguaranteed to be unique within your Workspace."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"The common name of this Task."},"description":{"type":"string","description":"A description of the work to be performed in this Task."},"plannedStartDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"The date when work on this Task is planned to begin.\r\n            \r\nThis value contains only the date in year-month-day format.  For display, this\r\ndate will always be shown as this same year-month-day regardless of time zone.\r\nFor reporting purposes, this date is calculated against the official time zone\r\nof the Workspace.\r\n            \r\nFor example: A Task has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"plannedFinishDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"The date when work on this Task is expected to complete.\r\n            \r\nThis value contains only the date in year-month-day format.  For display, this\r\ndate will always be shown as this same year-month-day regardless of time zone.\r\nFor reporting purposes, this date is calculated against the official time zone\r\nof the Workspace.\r\n            \r\nFor example: A Task has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"actualStartDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"If set, this is the actual date when work began on the Task.\r\n            \r\nThis value contains only the date in year-month-day format.  For display, this\r\ndate will always be shown as this same year-month-day regardless of time zone.\r\nFor reporting purposes, this date is calculated against the official time zone\r\nof the Workspace.\r\n            \r\nFor example: A Task has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"actualFinishDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"If set, this is the actual date when work was completed on this Task.\r\n            \r\nThis value contains only the date in year-month-day format.  For display, this\r\ndate will always be shown as this same year-month-day regardless of time zone.\r\nFor reporting purposes, this date is calculated against the official time zone\r\nof the Workspace.\r\n            \r\nFor example: A Task has a planned completion date of July 5, 2023 in a Workspace\r\nthat has a time zone of US Pacific Time (GMT-7 or GMT-8, depending on daylight\r\nsavings time).  This project is considered overdue on 12:01 AM July 6th 2023 in\r\nUS Pacific time."},"modifyDate":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"The timestamp in UTC when this Task was most recently modified."},"createDate":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"The timestamp in UTC when this Task was created."},"percentComplete":{"type":"integer","description":"The numerical percentage, from 0-100, representing the percentage completion\r\nfor this Task.  Any numbers below zero or above 100 will be clamped to the\r\nminimum or maximum value.\r\n            \r\nThis value can be edited manually in the Gantt chart view of the application,\r\nor can be selected on the Task Detail page within the Kanban board."},"isSummary":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if this Task is the parent of multiple Tasks underneath it.  A parent Task\r\nis a \"rolled-up\" view of multiple children that allows you to view a section of\r\nwork at a glance.\r\n            \r\nYou can create a summary Task in the Gantt chart view of the application by\r\nadding child tasks underneath a parent Task."},"priorityId":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Return the priority of a task"},"wbs":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"The WBS (Work Breakdown Structure) number for this task within the Gantt chart hierarchy.  See [What\r\nIs a Work Breakdown Structure (WBS)?](https://www.projectmanager.com/guides/work-breakdown-structure)\r\non Project Manager for more information. The WBS number is an outline number in the form `#.#.#.#`\r\nwhich indicates how tasks are organized and sorted.\r\n            \r\nThe WBS value is only available to users at certain edition levels.  This value can only be changed\r\nif you are a Project Editor."},"color":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Task Color as set in the Gantt"},"actualCost":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"The actual cost of this Task, if known."},"actualResourceCost":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"The actual resource cost of this Task"},"actualEffort":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The actual effort (in minutes) of this task, if known."},"plannedCost":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"The planned cost for this Task.  Cannot be negative."},"plannedResourceCost":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"The planned resource cost of this Task"},"plannedEffort":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"The planned effort (in minutes) of this task, if known."}},"description":"A Task is an individual element of work that must be performed to complete a Project.  A\r\nTask can have one or more Resources assigned to it.  Tasks can be linked to other Tasks to\r\nindicate whether they have a dependency or a connection.","title":"TimesheetTaskDto"},"TimeSheetProjectDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of the Project."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"The name of the Project."},"description":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"An optional description of the Project"},"shortCode":{"type":"string","description":"A shortened name that will be used when reporting on Projects.  This short\r\nname can be edited in the Project Settings page within the application\r\nand can be any text you wish."},"shortId":{"type":"string","description":"A short identifier that uniquely identifies this Project within your Workspace\r\nusing a single letter followed by a number.  This code can be used for APIs\r\nthat accept Project unique identifiers.\r\n            \r\nYou can observe the short ID within the application by observing the URL of\r\nthe page you visit when you click on this project.  The page's URL will appear\r\nin the form `https://pm.app.projectmanager.com/project/board/D16` - in this\r\nexample, the `ShortId` is `D16`.\r\n            \r\nThis code is automatically assigned for you and cannot be changed."},"startDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time","description":"The earliest planned or actual start date of tasks on the project.\r\n            \r\nThis field is calculated automatically and cannot be changed."},"endDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time","description":"The latest planned or actual finish date of tasks on the project.\r\n            \r\nThis field is calculated automatically and cannot be changed."},"targetDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time","description":"The target planned completion date for this Project, or null if one has\r\nnot been selected.  This value can be updated in the Project Settings\r\npage or the Portfolio Project page within the application."},"budget":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"The proposed budget for this Project."},"hourlyRate":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"The default hourly rate for work on this Project.  This rate will be used\r\nif an assignee working on this Project does not have an hourly rate configured\r\nin their profile."},"statusUpdate":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Contains an optional status update for Projects that can be used to summarize\r\nthe status of multiple Projects at a glance.\r\n            \r\nYou can edit the StatusUpdate field on the Portfolio page of the application."},"modifyDate":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"The timestamp in UTC when the Project was most recently modified."},"createDate":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"The timestamp in UTC when the Project was created."},"isTemplate":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if this Project is a template that will be reused as a framework\r\nfor future Projects."}},"description":"A Project is a collection of Tasks that contributes towards a goal.  Within a Project, Tasks\r\nrepresent individual items of work that team members must complete.  The sum total of Tasks\r\nwithin a Project represents the work to be completed for that Project.","title":"TimeSheetProjectDto"},"TimesheetResourceDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of this Resource."},"firstName":{"type":"string","description":"The first name of the person Resource.\r\n            \r\nApplies to personnel Resources only."},"lastName":{"type":"string","description":"The last name of the person Resource.\r\n            \r\nApplies to personnel Resources only."},"email":{"type":"string","description":"The email address of this Resource."},"hourlyRate":{"type":["number","null"],"format":"double","description":"The default hourly rate of the resource."}},"description":"A Resource represents a person, material, or tool that is used within your Projects.\r\nWhen you attach a Resources to more than one Task, the software will schedule the usage\r\nof your Resource so that it is not allocated to more than one Task at the same time.\r\nThe users in your Workspace are also considered Resources.  To invite a new User to your\r\nWorkspace, create a new Resource for that user.","title":"TimesheetResourceDto"},"TimesheetAdminTypeDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"admin task id"},"name":{"type":"string","description":"admin task name"}},"description":"Represents admin task to track time","title":"TimesheetAdminTypeDto"},"TimesheetFileDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The identifier for this file"},"name":{"type":"string","description":"The name of the file"},"url":{"type":"string","description":"The url of the file which can be used for downloading"}},"description":"Represents information about a file attached to a Timesheet.","title":"TimesheetFileDto"},"TimesheetDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"A unique identifier of a timesheet data entry"},"resourceId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of the resource who is preparing this Timesheet.  You can filter on this value to measure\r\nthe total work performed by this specific Resource."},"taskId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of the task worked on for this Timesheet.  You can filter on this value to measure the\r\ntotal work performed against a specific Task."},"projectId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"The unique identifier of the project worked on for this Timesheet.  You can filter on this value to measure the\r\ntotal work performed against a specific Project."},"date":{"type":"string","format":"date","description":"The date of this time entry record.  You can filter on this value to obtain Timesheet data for a specific date\r\nrange."},"notes":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Notes associated with this Timesheet, if any"},"approved":{"type":"boolean","description":"True if this Timesheet was approved by a person with the role of a Timesheet approver"},"approvalStatusId":{"type":"integer","description":"Approval status of the timesheet entry.\r\n1 = New (not submitted for approval)\r\n2 = Submitted (submitted for approval, pending review)\r\n3 = Approved (approved by the approver)\r\n4 = Declined (declined by the approver)"},"hours":{"type":"number","format":"double","description":"Total Hours spent on this Task by this Resource on this specific Date"},"minutes":{"type":"integer","description":"Total minutes spent on this Task by this Resource on this specific Date"},"modifiedDate":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"Date and time (in UTC) that this timesheet entry was last modified."},"task":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TimesheetTaskDto"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The task associated with this timesheet entry"},"project":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TimeSheetProjectDto"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The project associated with this timesheet entry"},"resource":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TimesheetResourceDto"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The resource associated with this timesheet entry"},"adminType":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TimesheetAdminTypeDto"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The administration type associated with this timesheet entry"},"files":{"type":["array","null"],"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TimesheetFileDto"},"description":"The list of files associated with this Timesheet, if any.\r\n            \r\nThis field will be present when you fetch a single object.\r\nWhen you query for multiple objects, this field is not included in results by default.\r\nTo expand this field, specify the name of this field in the `$expand` parameter."},"isCopied":{"type":"boolean","description":"Indicates if the timesheet entry is copied from another week."}},"description":"A Timesheet entry is a single record that contains information about time spent by a person on a task.  Each\r\nTimesheet entry object contains information about one task/day/person combination.  A fully completed Timesheet\r\nwill often contain multiple records for the same date range which must be combined to produce a finished\r\nTimesheet.